# Fifteen: the A14 Trace from U1 pin 24 to U3 pin 6 (2A3) is cracked: the buffer's input floats high,
# so LA14 is always 1 and D15 always lit. The CPU counts as usual.
machine heartbeat
title "Fifteen"
brief "The second light from the left, D15, is always lit: it never blinks. The others look as they should."
fault crack U1.A14 U3.2A3 50%
